  "description": "Control-plane companion to Compendium.Adapters.Supabase. A stateless ISupabaseAdmin facade over the Supabase Cloud Management API (project create / get / delete, project API keys) and the Storage admin API (bucket create / list / delete), plus a bring-your-own / self-hosted attach probe. Every call takes an explicit, redacting SupabaseConnection and returns the Result pattern; capabilities gate cloud vs self-hosted vs keys-only.",
